#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "CampusInterface is a full-site-editing block theme for schools, academies, online course creators and training companies. Everything is styled from theme.json: colour roles, fluid type with two bundled variable fonts, a spacing scale and responsive styles, with Campus, Studio, Kids, Corporate and Dark colour variations, Editorial, Modern and System type sets, and section styles for bands and cards. It pairs with the free Public LMS plugin, whose course, lesson and dashboard templates it styles, and works as a clean school website without it."
msgstr ""

